---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Every Real Estate Calculator"
  description="Learn why we build free real estate calculators and RealtorCRM: practical tools, transparent methods and clear estimates for every property decision."
  canonical="https://everyrealestatecalculator.com/about/"
  currentNav="about"
  extraStyles={["../assets/supporting.css","about.css"]}
>
<main id="main" class="supporting-page about-page">
  <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="wrap about-hero-grid">
      <div class="about-hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="hero-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>Calculators · Guides</p>
        <h1 id="about-title">Free real estate calculators for every deal.</h1>
        <p>A free calculator for every part of the deal — mortgages, affordability, rental returns, commissions and taxes. Every formula is shown and every result explained, and you never need an account to use them.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="../tools/">Explore free tools <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-shot">
        <img src="down-payment-calculator-hero.webp" srcset="down-payment-calculator-hero-720.webp 1240w, down-payment-calculator-hero.webp 2280w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1248px) calc((100vw - 96px) * .54), 622px" width="2280" height="1258" alt="The Down Payment Calculator showing an estimated $52,000 cash to close on a $400,000 home." fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="purpose-title">
    <div class="wrap about-editorial-split">
      <h2 id="purpose-title">Why we built this platform.</h2>
      <div class="about-prose"><p>Real estate decisions involve more than property prices. Financing, expenses, taxes and investment returns all play a role.</p><p>We bring these calculations together in one place, with clear formulas and free access to our tools. Our aim is to help people understand their options before making important property decisions.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="products-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="products-title">What we offer</h2>
      <article class="about-product" aria-labelledby="calculators-title">
        <img class="about-product-photo" src="property-planning.webp" srcset="property-planning-720.webp 720w, property-planning.webp 1440w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1248px) calc((100vw - 112px) * .55), 625px" alt="Architectural plans, a scale model, drafting tools and a sketchbook on a light desk." width="1440" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <div class="about-product-copy"><h3 id="calculators-title">Real Estate Calculators</h3><p>Sixteen free calculators covering mortgages, affordability, investment returns, commissions and more. Each tool can be used without creating an account.</p><a class="card-arrow" href="../tools/">Browse calculators <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="about-product about-crm" aria-labelledby="crm-title">
        <div class="about-product-copy"><h3 id="crm-title">RealtorCRM</h3><p>A dedicated workspace for real estate professionals to organize contacts, deals, appointments and follow-ups, keeping daily workflows on track.</p><a class="card-arrow" href="../real-estate-crm/">Discover RealtorCRM <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div>
        <img class="about-product-photo" src="professional-workspace.webp" srcset="professional-workspace-720.webp 720w, professional-workspace.webp 1440w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1248px) calc((100vw - 112px) * .55), 625px" alt="A laptop, handwritten notepad and coffee on a wooden desk beside a window." width="1440" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
    <div class="wrap"><h2 id="audience-title">Who our tools are for</h2>
      <dl class="about-directory">
        <div><dt>Homebuyers</dt><dd>Plan a purchase and understand financing.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Homeowners &amp; Sellers</dt><dd>Estimate costs associated with selling property.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Property Investors</dt><dd>Evaluate income, expenses and investment returns.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Real Estate Agents</dt><dd>Calculate commissions and organize client relationships.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <div class="wrap about-editorial-split"><h2 id="approach-title">How we approach accuracy</h2>
      <div class="about-prose"><p>Our calculators explain the formulas, inputs and assumptions behind each estimate. Worked examples help users understand and check their results.</p><p>Every estimate has limitations. Our tools are designed for education and planning, not as a replacement for professional financial, legal or tax advice.</p><a class="card-arrow" href="../resources/">Explore our educational resources <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
    <div class="wrap"><div class="about-closing"><div><h2 id="closing-title">Find the right tool for your next decision.</h2><p>Free calculators and practical real estate guides.</p></div><div class="about-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="../tools/">Explore Free Tools</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="../resources/">Explore Resources</a></div></div></div>
  </section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
